	(text "DRAFT / NOT FOR ORDER - RTC leaf, not integrated\nU9201 = DS3231SN+; stock DS3231M symbol reused ONLY after pin-map check.\nNC pins 5..12 MUST be GND. RST is NOT connected to ESP32 EN or safety reset.\nCR2032 is NON-RECHARGEABLE. No charging path. VBAT_RTC feeds RTC only.\nRTC_SDA/RTC_SCL: 3V3 I2C, 100kHz target; MCU GPIO allocation pending.\nPower on return NEVER authorizes ignition. OSF/invalid time disables calendar features.\nPurchasing: Keystone1060 ChipDip8049467254. DS3231SN+ sourcing not yet verified.\nNot fitted to main PCB; no physical battery/backfeed or timekeeping tests yet."
	(at 25.4 114.3 0)
